WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Feedback is a signal, not a command. Turn feedback into governed evidence for change.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Capture purpose, consent and context.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Separate identity from sensitive detail.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Classify correction, need or preference.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Test impact before changing product.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Govern the route from signal to change.
